      "message": "Do you elaborate somewhere on why the Servo doesn\u0027t use the timer facilities? Or on how usb_tc_snk_sm.c uses timers in general? The design seems different than how we usually access timers on the EC.",
      "revId": "d052d4b0c319bf17800a5b6df344aa9cbc70bc50",
